repository-code: "https://github.com/NabiBukhsh-AI/Resume-AI-Parser"
url: "https://github.com/NabiBukhsh-AI/Resume-AI-Parser"
abstract: >-
  A production-grade resume parsing and job-matching engine. Documents are converted into a
  Pydantic-validated structured record using LLM constrained decoding, while every derived
  quantity - total experience, seniority, tenure, match scores - is computed deterministically
  in Python rather than generated by the model, making those fields exact and reproducible.
keywords:
  - resume parsing
  - information extraction
  - structured output
  - large language models
  - applicant tracking
  - job matching
